  "summary": "Warsh disclosed 65 transactions between May 27, 2026, and Aug. 3, 2026, consisting of 64 sales (estimated $47.3 million) and one purchase (estimated $175,000). Fifty-five of the 65 rows were sales of numbered series of THSDFS LLC; the rest were sales of Bessemer Venture Associates funds, Lansing Management Onshore LP, DCM Investments, Goat Growth Fund II LP and stakes in the startups Aven, Hebbia and Arcana Analytics. The single purchase was an exercise of vested Aven stock options, paired with a same-day sale of the resulting stock. Eleven sales, including the Aug. 3, 2026, sale of Arcana Analytics, fell in the filings’ largest reported range, $1,000,001 to $5,000,000. None of the 65 transactions were late-filed.",
